{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"The chicken's right there.|So you grab it yourself."},{"id":"s2","text":"Everyone freezes."},{"id":"s3","text":"Konbini rules."},{"id":"s4","text":"Point at it.|She does the rest."},{"id":"s5","text":"She reaches in."},{"id":"s6","text":"She leans in—"},{"id":"s7","text":"She wraps it.|You wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Hot. Crispy.|Worth the wait."},{"id":"s9","text":"Point. Don't grab.|That's the rule."},{"id":"n1","text":"Hot case snacks.|Not self-serve."},{"id":"n2","text":"Ask the clerk.|Or just point."},{"id":"n3","text":"Same price.|She serves it."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}